      "message": "fix(import): refuse STEP length units read as millimetres\n\nThe model read now refuses by name a file with a length unit that no\nunit context states, a unit context that names a missing unit, and a\nsolid whose own context states no length unit while the file states\none. Each case read the model at 1 mm per unit without a word.\n\nFixes #2919\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
