      "message": "Merge origin/main into issue/2919-step-short-units\n\nConflicted file and its resolution:\n- crates/kernel/src/lib.rs: this branch adds `mod step_length_units;`,\n  main adds `pub mod step_edge_gap;` at the same place. Both are kept.\n\ncrates/kernel/src/solidcore_step.rs merged without a conflict: main's\nedge-gap cap (#2976) and this branch's unit refusal are in different\nhunks of read_guarded.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
